---
import { images } from "../data/images"
---

<section
  class="bg-inverted px-container-x py-section text-inverted-foreground palette-surface-primary"
>
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-landing gap-12">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p
        class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-inverted-foreground/60"
      >
        Dos mesas
      </p>
      <h2
        class="max-w-heading font-display text-headline-2 leading-none uppercase"
      >
        Abundancia. Resolver.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-px md:grid-cols-2">
      <div
        class="relative min-h-[50vh] overflow-hidden border border-inverted-foreground/20"
      >
        <img
          src={images.cayoCoco.src}
          alt={images.cayoCoco.alt}
          width={images.cayoCoco.width}
          height={images.cayoCoco.height}
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover photo-tone"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-inverted/30"></div>
        <div class="relative flex min-h-[50vh] flex-col justify-end p-6">
          <p class="font-display text-headline-3 leading-none uppercase">
            La mesa del turista
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-inverted-foreground/70">
            Buffet, langosta, variedad, abundancia visible. Un mundo preparado
            para el visitante.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative min-h-[50vh] overflow-hidden border border-inverted-foreground/20"
      >
        <img
          src={images.streetLife.src}
          alt={images.streetLife.alt}
          width={images.streetLife.width}
          height={images.streetLife.height}
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover photo-tone"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-inverted/30"></div>
        <div class="relative flex min-h-[50vh] flex-col justify-end p-6">
          <p class="font-display text-headline-3 leading-none uppercase">
            La mesa del residente
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-inverted-foreground/70">
            Colas, libretas de racionamiento, escasez, invención. Un mundo donde
            comer puede requerir estrategia.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p
      class="mx-auto max-w-copy text-center text-lg text-inverted-foreground/70"
    >
      No son necesariamente el mismo día ni el mismo lugar. Pero coexisten
      dentro del mismo país, separados por la valla de un resort.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
